/?p=4220266" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Heritage Festival</a>, <a href="https://discoversouthcarolina.com/articles/living-history-at-freewoods-farm" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Freewoods Farm</a>. Surfside Beach: <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/322/Surfside-Beach-Hula-Fire-Dancer-Show" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fire dancers</a>, <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/345/Trolley-of-Christmas-Lights" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">trolleys</a>, <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/325/Surfside-Beach-Farmers-Market" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">farmers market</a>, <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/204/Swimming-Surfing-Safety" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">surfing rules</a>. Garden City: <a href="https://www.dnr.sc.gov/fish/swfaqs.html" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">crabbing</a>, <a href="https://www.myrtlebeachareacvb.com/news/myrtle-beach-lights-up-july-4th-with-fireworks-festivals-and-family-fun" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">golf cart parade</a>, <a href="https://gulfstreamcafe.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gulfstream Cafe</a>, <a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/departments/parksandrecreation/beach-accesses/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">beach accesses</a>. Murrells Inlet: <a href="https://marshwalk.com/history/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer